ing and disturbing imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strong Language: Includes strong language and potentially offensive terms reflecting the brutal nature of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Themes: Explores psychological trauma, existential dread, and the horrors of war. The protagonist\u2019s struggle with a demonic mark adds psychological horror. Encounters with skeletal soldiers and dark secrets contribute to the game\u2019s dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival Horror: Navigate deadly environments, solve cryptic puzzles, and survive against monstrous creatures while battling a worsening supernatural curse.</p>","developers":["LEMIOUTGAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057020/header.jpg?t=1728490764","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2023 - 2024 LEMIOUTGAMES","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257037685,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037685/movie480.mp4?t=1720907611","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037685/movie_max.mp4?t=1720907611"},"name":"Forgotten Bunker 1939 Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257037685/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720907611","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037685/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1720907611","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037685/movie_